{"articleNo":"79552","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=79552&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"경기도 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원사업 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.03.13","hit":"5341","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M\">경기도 대학생 학자금 대출이자 지원사업 안내 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <!--?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 사업목적</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 대학생들의 가장 큰 부담인 등록금 문제와 관련하여 학자금 대출이자를 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 지원함으로써 대학생 학업전념 환경을 조성하고 학부모 가계부담을 경감</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 지원대상</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #0909d9; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">경기도에 주소지를 둔</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0909d9; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #0909d9; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">’13년 1학기 한국장학재단 학자금 대출</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 학생 중</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 다자녀 가구(3인이상)의 둘째 이후 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- 일반상환학자금 대출을 받고 현역으로 군복무 중인 대학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 한양중고딕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한양중고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양중고딕\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; (취업후상환학자금 대출 군 복무자는 2012년부터 정부에서 전액 이자지원)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나. </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">’10년 2학기부터 ’12년까지 일반상환학자금 경기도 지원 대상자로 선정된</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">학생(저소득층 ― 소득 4~7분위) 중 재학 중인 학생</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HY헤드라인M; FONT-SIZE: 17pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 2013년 학자금 대출이자 지원 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;가. 신청방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">별도로 신청할 필요 없음</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;- </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">한국장학재단과의 업무 협약 체결로 학자금 대출 학생 명단을 제공 받아</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char; MARGIN-LEFT: 26pt\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">다자녀·군복무 여부, 기 지원대상자 학적조회 후 대상자 선정 일괄 지원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;나. 지원시기 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">연 2회(6월말, 12월말)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;다. 지원금액 :「경기도 학자금 이자지원 심의위원회」에서 결정(6월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;라. 지원안내 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">대상자로 선정된 학생에게는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-ascii-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy\">이메일 및 SMS로 개별 통보</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">(7월)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: HCI Poppy; FONT-SIZE: 15pt; mso-hansi-font-family: HCI Poppy; mso-fareast-font-family: 휴먼명조\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;마. 지원일정</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; LAYOUT-GRID-MODE: char\" class=\"본문\"></p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.2